msgid "Black Belt (Expert or Insane); trade Everstones equal to the target level."
msgstr "Karatéka (Expert ou Insane) ; le nombre de Pierres Stase correspond au niveau visé."

#. Preserve prerequisites, shared levels and exact cost ranges.
msgctxt "page:Defeat the Black Belt; levels 2–7 cost 2–7 Star Pieces, levels 8–10 cost 2–4 Comet Shards. All six Power items share the level."
msgid "Defeat the Black Belt; levels 2–7 cost 2–7 Star Pieces, levels 8–10 cost 2–4 Comet Shards. All six Power items share the level."
msgstr "Battez le Karatéka ; les niveaux 2–7 coûtent 2–7 Morceaux Étoile, les niveaux 8–10 coûtent 2–4 Morceaux Comète. Les six objets Pouvoir partagent le même niveau."

#. Preserve prerequisites, shared levels and exact cost ranges.
msgctxt "page:Statue of Regi rewards one level below level 10; further upgrades cost Big Nuggets equal to the target level. Luck Incense shares the level."
msgid "Statue of Regi rewards one level below level 10; further upgrades cost Big Nuggets equal to the target level. Luck Incense shares the level."
msgstr "Statue of Regi accorde un niveau tant qu’il est inférieur à 10 ; les améliorations suivantes coûtent autant de Maxi Pépites que le niveau visé. L’Encens Veine partage ce niveau."

#. Preserve prerequisites, shared levels and exact cost ranges.
msgctxt "page:Exp. Millionaire rewards level 2; levels 3–7 cost 3–7 Big Pearls, levels 8–10 cost 2–4 Pearl Strings."
msgid "Exp. Millionaire rewards level 2; levels 3–7 cost 3–7 Big Pearls, levels 8–10 cost 2–4 Pearl Strings."
msgstr "Exp. Millionaire accorde le niveau 2 ; les niveaux 3–7 coûtent 3–7 Grandes Perles, les niveaux 8–10 coûtent 2–4 Perles Triples."

